1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:02,970
(Sheldon:)By any standard,
Amy is more similar to me

2
00:00:02,970 --> 00:00:04,290
(Sheldon:)than anyone I've ever met.

3
00:00:04,290 --> 00:00:07,090
(Mrs Cooper:)Oh, I'm sorry, Shelly,
I can't see it.

4
00:00:07,090 --> 00:00:09,990
(Sheldon:)Well, whether you see
it or not is irrelevant.

5
00:00:09,990 --> 00:00:11,990
(Sheldon:)I can't see subatomic particles,

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,850
(Sheldon:)but nevertheless, they're there.

7
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:14,960
(Amy:)Excellent point.

8
00:00:14,970 --> 00:00:16,700
(Sheldon:)A physics point.

9
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:19,240
Touché.

10
00:00:19,240 --> 00:00:21,570
(Mrs Cooper:)Well, putting aside the pig Latin,

11
00:00:21,570 --> 00:00:23,410
(Mrs Cooper:)it's a good thing that

12
00:00:23,410 --> 00:00:25,360
(Mrs Cooper:)you two decided to
end the relationship

13
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:27,810
(Mrs Cooper:)so I didn't have to end it for you.

14
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:31,830
(Sheldon:)Amy, after consideration,

15
00:00:31,830 --> 00:00:34,030
(Sheldon:)I believe we may have acted rashly.

16
00:00:34,030 --> 00:00:35,900
(Sheldon:)I propose we resume
our relationship

17
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:38,400
(Sheldon:)and attempt to resolve
our differences.

18
00:00:38,410 --> 00:00:40,360
(Amy:)I'll agree to that only
if you'll stipulate

19
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:42,460
(Amy:)that 80% of our difficulties
were caused by you.

20
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:44,240
I'll go as high as 40. Sixty-five.

21
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:45,780
(Sheldon:)Done.

22
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:47,780
(Sheldon:)You understand that moving forward,

23
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:51,270
(Sheldon:)we deal with the fact that my
mother does not approve of you?

24
00:00:51,270 --> 00:00:54,240
(Amy:)I do. I find being cast

25
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:56,920
(Amy:)in the role of bad
girl oddly titillating.

26
00:00:58,580 --> 00:01:00,340
(Sheldon:)Would you like to see my cats?

